OL,12,G2130 The History of the Weekend
OL,13,     FOn May 1st 1926, Ford introduced
OL,14,     Fthe standard five day week. One
OL,15,     Fhundred years later, Siofra
OL,16,     FMulqueen takes a look at the
OL,17,     Fhistory of the weekend & asks
OL,18,     Fshould we be reexamining it.
